{
    "name": "E2E Shopify - Discount Codes",
    "description": "Create a discount code, read it back by its code, delete it.",
    "notes": {
        "fcd687f0-eeaa-41b7-af16-73a14783e955": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 320,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 256,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data\n\nThe flow creates all of its own data:\n\n1. **Create Discount Code** leaves the code empty on purpose, so the component generates a random 8-character code. Shopify rejects duplicate codes, so a fixed code would fail on the second run.\n2. **Get Discount Code** reads the discount back by that code and the asserts check its terms.\n3. **Delete Discount Code** after `AfterAll` removes the discount with its code.\n\nThe account needs the `read_discounts` and `write_discounts` scopes."
        }
    },
